   "source": [
    "## Logistic regression\n",
    "- Recap: the logloss metric is the cost function\n",
    "\n",
    "<center>$L(w) = - \\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{i=1}^{m} [y_i\\ln(y_i') + (1-y_i)\\ln(1-y_i')]$ </center>\n",
    "<center>$L(w) =  - \\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{i=1}^{m} [y_i\\ln(\\frac{1}{1+e^{-w_0 + \\sum_{j=1}^{d} w_j  x_{ij}}}) + (1-y_i)\\ln(1-\\frac{1}{1+e^{-w_0 + \\sum_{j=1}^{d} w_j  x_{ij}}})]$</center>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": "subslide"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "   - the logloss metric with l1 regularization\n",
    "\n",
    "<center>$L(w) = - \\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{i=1}^{m} [y_i\\ln(\\frac{1}{1+e^{-w_0 + \\sum_{j=1}^{d} w_j  x_{ij}}}) + (1-y_i)\\ln(1-\\frac{1}{1+e^{-w_0 + \\sum_{j=1}^{d} w_j  x_{ij}}}))] + \\color{red}{ \\alpha \\sum_{j=0}^{d}|w_j|}$</center>\n",
    "\n",
    "   - the logloss metric with l2 regularization\n",
    "\n",
    "<center>$L(w) = - \\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{i=1}^{m} [y_i\\ln(\\frac{1}{1+e^{-w_0 + \\sum_{j=1}^{d} w_j  x_{ij}}}) + (1-y_i)\\ln(1-\\frac{1}{1+e^{-w_0 + \\sum_{j=1}^{d} w_j  x_{ij}}}))] + \\color{red}{\\alpha \\sum_{j=0}^{d} w_j^2}$</center>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": "subslide"
    }
   },
   "source": [
